<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>RovaFleet Privacy Policy</title>
    <style>
        :root { --ink:#18202A; --muted:#66727E; --teal:#176B68; --coral:#E65F4C; --line:#D4DEE2; --bg:#EEF3F4; --card:#FFFFFF; }
        * { box-sizing: border-box; }
        body { margin: 0; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.65; color: var(--ink); background: var(--bg); }
        .page { max-width: 880px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 24px 18px 40px; }
        .hero { background: var(--card); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 8px; padding: 24px; }
        .logo { width: 92px; height: 92px; border-radius: 8px; object-fit: cover; display: block; margin-bottom: 16px; }
        h1 { margin: 0; font-size: clamp(28px, 6vw, 42px); }
        h2 { margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 20px; }
        p { margin: 0 0 10px; }
        .muted { color: var(--muted); }
        .summary { margin-top: 16px; padding: 14px 16px; border-left: 4px solid var(--coral); background: #F8FAFA; border-radius: 8px; }
        .card { background: var(--card); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 8px; padding: 20px; margin-top: 14px; }
        a { color: var(--teal); }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <main class="page">
        <section class="hero">
            <img class="logo" src="rovafleet_logo_concept.png" alt="RovaFleet logo">
            <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
            <p class="muted">Effective date: May 29, 2026</p>
            <div class="summary"><strong>Summary:</strong> RovaFleet works offline, requires no account, includes no ads or analytics, and saves optional quote drafts only on your device.</div>
        </section>

        <section class="card">
            <h2>Data Collection</h2>
            <p>RovaFleet does not collect, transmit, sell, or share personal data.</p>
            <p>The app does not include analytics SDKs, advertising SDKs, tracking technologies, social login, or account registration.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="card">
            <h2>Local Storage</h2>
            <p>If you save a quote draft, the draft details are stored locally in the app storage area on the same device.</p>
            <p>Saved drafts remain on the device until you delete them in the app or clear the app data from Android settings.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="card">
            <h2>Permissions</h2>
            <p>RovaFleet does not request Internet, location, camera, microphone, contacts, or storage permissions.</p>
            <p>The app may open your email app when you choose the support contact button. Sending email is handled by your email app, not by RovaFleet.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="card">
            <h2>App Scope</h2>
            <p>RovaFleet is an offline rental quote planning tool. It does not submit booking requests, show live availability, process payments, or contact rental businesses automatically.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="card">
            <h2>Contact</h2>
            <p>For privacy questions, contact <a href="mailto:support@example.com">support@example.com</a>.</p>
        </section>
    </main>
</body>
</html>
